---
description: Blocks generic counter-plus-polling UI synchronization.
globs: "**/*ViewModel.swift,**/*Coordinator.swift,**/*Service.swift,**/*Storage*.swift,**/*Container.swift"
---

# UI State Synchronization

Do not synchronize UI through a monotonically increasing generic Int
(`changeVersion`, `mutationVersion`, `dataGeneration`, `revision`) observed by
a `while !Task.isCancelled` polling loop.

Use semantic `@Observable` properties, `@Query`/`@Bindable` for live models, or
payload-bearing domain events. The Stop and pre-commit hooks detect the banned
combination. A deliberate exception requires an ADR and
`ui-state-sync-exception.stamp.md`.
